  "砖 / 石材（Masonry）": "Brick / masonry", "每年春秋检查灰缝，松动、脱落处需要勾缝修补（tuckpointing）。": "Check mortar joints each spring and fall; loose or missing mortar needs tuckpointing.",
  "清洗用低压水和软刷，高压水枪会冲坏灰缝。": "Clean with low-pressure water and a soft brush; pressure washers damage mortar.",
  "芝加哥这类冻融地区，渗进砖里的水结冰会让砖面剥落：保持排水槽和落水管把水引离墙面。": "In freeze-thaw climates like Chicago, water trapped in brick spalls the face: keep gutters and downspouts carrying water away from walls.",
  "是否涂防水剂先咨询专业人士，不透气的涂层会把湿气封在砖里。": "Ask a professional before sealing; non-breathable coatings trap moisture in the brick.",
  "乙烯基外墙板（Vinyl siding）": "Vinyl siding", "每年用温和肥皂水和软毛刷自上而下清洗一次，不要用高压水对着接缝冲。": "Wash once a year top-down with mild soapy water and a soft brush; never aim a pressure washer at the seams.",
  "大风、冰雹后检查有没有松脱或开裂的板材。": "After high wind or hail, check for loose or cracked panels.", "烧烤炉离墙远一点，高温会让板材变形。": "Keep grills away from the wall; heat warps the panels.",
  "木质外墙": "Wood siding", "通常 3–7 年重新上漆或染色一次，日晒多的一面更快。": "Repaint or restain every 3–7 years; sunny sides sooner.", "每年检查腐朽、开裂和缝隙，及时打胶。": "Check yearly for rot, cracks and gaps; caulk promptly.", "植物和土壤与墙面保持距离，减少受潮。": "Keep plants and soil off the wall to reduce moisture.",
  "纤维水泥板（如 Hardie）": "Fiber cement (e.g. Hardie)", "漆面比木材耐久，重新上漆周期较长，以厂家说明为准。": "Paint lasts longer than on wood; repaint per the manufacturer's guidance.", "定期检查接缝和窗边的密封胶。": "Check caulk at seams and around windows regularly.",
  "灰泥（Stucco）": "Stucco", "每年检查裂缝；细小裂缝可用专用填补剂处理。": "Check for cracks yearly; hairline cracks can take a stucco patch.", "较大裂缝、鼓包或墙内潮湿，请专业人士检查是否渗水。": "Larger cracks, bulges or damp inside walls need a professional leak check.",
  "外墙涂料 / 真石漆": "Exterior paint / stone-effect coating", "公寓外墙一般由物业统一维护，发现渗水、起皮、空鼓及时报修。": "Apartment exteriors are usually maintained by management; report leaks, peeling or hollow spots.", "别墅自管时，通常 8–10 年翻新一次，以涂料说明为准。": "Self-maintained houses: refresh every 8–10 years, per the coating's guidance.",
  "外墙瓷砖": "Exterior tile", "瓷砖空鼓、松动有坠落风险，发现后立即报物业或请专业人员处理。": "Hollow or loose tiles can fall; report to management or a professional immediately.",
  "沥青瓦": "Asphalt shingles", "每年春秋以及大风冰雹后，从地面目视检查缺瓦、翘边、裸露的钉子。": "Each spring and fall and after storms, check from the ground for missing shingles, lifted edges and exposed nails.",
  "排水槽每年至少清理两次：春季一次，秋季落叶后一次。": "Clean gutters at least twice a year: spring, and fall after the leaves drop.", "冬季注意屋檐冰坝（ice dam），根本办法是做好阁楼保温和通风。": "Watch for ice dams in winter; the real fix is attic insulation and ventilation.", "常见寿命约 20–25 年。": "Typical lifespan about 20–25 years.",
  "金属屋面": "Metal roof", "定期检查螺钉和密封垫圈是否老化。": "Check screws and washers for aging periodically.", "寿命较长，常见 40 年以上。": "Long-lived, commonly 40+ years.",
  "陶瓦 / 水泥瓦": "Clay / concrete tile", "瓦片易碎，不要随意踩踏。": "Tiles crack easily; don't walk on them.", "大风后检查有无碎瓦、移位。": "After high wind check for broken or shifted tiles.",
  "平屋面（防水层）": "Flat roof (membrane)", "每年检查是否积水、防水层是否起鼓开裂，保持排水口通畅。": "Check yearly for ponding, blisters or cracks in the membrane; keep drains clear.", "公寓顶层发现屋面漏水，先报物业或 HOA；公共屋面通常由维修基金或 HOA 负责。": "Top-floor leaks: report to management or the HOA first; shared roofs are usually their responsibility.",
  "实木地板": "Hardwood", "日常吸尘或干拖；清洁用中性木地板清洁剂，拖把拧到微湿，不要用蒸汽拖把。": "Vacuum or dry-mop; clean with a neutral hardwood cleaner and a barely damp mop, never a steam mop.", "家具脚贴毛毡垫，门口放地垫挡砂石。": "Felt pads under furniture, doormats to keep grit out.",
  "室内湿度保持约 35%–55%；北方冬季暖气干燥容易出现缝隙，可开加湿器。": "Keep indoor humidity around 35–55%; dry winter heating opens gaps, so run a humidifier.", "表面磨损时约 3–5 年做一次表层翻新（screen & recoat），深度划痕再考虑整体打磨。": "Screen and recoat every 3–5 years as the finish wears; full sanding only for deep scratches.",
  "实木复合地板": "Engineered hardwood", "保养方式同实木，但表层较薄，整体打磨的次数有限。": "Care like hardwood, but the thin veneer limits how often it can be sanded.", "有地暖时选标明适用地暖的产品，升温要缓慢分段。": "With floor heating, use products rated for it and warm up gradually.",
  "强化复合地板": "Laminate", "只能微湿拖，避免积水，遇水容易膨胀。": "Barely damp mop only; standing water swells it.", "不需要打蜡或抛光。": "No waxing or polishing needed.",
  "乙烯基地板（LVP / SPC）": "Vinyl plank (LVP / SPC)", "耐水，可以湿拖；避免钢丝球等研磨工具。": "Waterproof, wet mopping is fine; avoid abrasive pads.", "部分橡胶底地垫会让地板变色。": "Some rubber-backed mats discolor the floor.",
  "瓷砖": "Tile", "填缝约 1–2 年做一次封护，视使用强度。": "Seal grout every 1–2 years depending on wear.", "卫生间发霉的玻璃胶及时铲掉重打。": "Replace moldy bathroom caulk promptly.",
