  "没有读到 config.js：文件可能没上传到网站根目录，或者有语法错误（常见：用了中文引号“”、少了逗号、key 中间断行）。": "config.js could not be read: it may be missing from the site root or have a syntax error (curly quotes, a missing comma, a key split across lines).",
  "网站上的 config.js 里地址和 key 都是空的，说明线上还是空白模板：确认改好的 config.js 已经提交到 GitHub，然后强制刷新。": "The deployed config.js has an empty URL and key, so the site is still the blank template. Commit your edited config.js and hard-refresh.",
  "config.js 里填了 key，但 SUPABASE_URL 是空的。": "config.js has a key but SUPABASE_URL is empty.", "config.js 里填了地址，但 SUPABASE_ANON_KEY 是空的。": "config.js has a URL but SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is empty.",
  "SUPABASE_URL 需要以 https:// 开头，例如 https://你的项目ID.supabase.co": "SUPABASE_URL must start with https://, e.g. https://your-project.supabase.co",
  "SUPABASE_URL 只填项目地址（https://你的项目ID.supabase.co），不要带 /rest/v1 之类的后缀。": "SUPABASE_URL should be just the project URL (https://your-project.supabase.co), without /rest/v1 or similar.",
  "config.js 里填的是 secret / service_role 密钥。这个密钥会绕过所有数据权限保护，放在公开网页里任何人都能读写你的数据库。请立即在 Supabase 控制台重新生成（Rotate）这个密钥，并改填 anon public 或 publishable key。": "config.js contains a secret / service_role key. It bypasses all data protection; on a public page anyone could read and write your database. Rotate it in the Supabase dashboard immediately and use the anon public or publishable key instead.",
  "SUPABASE_ANON_KEY 看起来不是有效的 key：应以 eyJ 开头（legacy anon key）或 sb_publishable_ 开头（publishable key）。复制时注意不要多出空格或少字符。": "SUPABASE_ANON_KEY doesn't look valid: it should start with eyJ (legacy anon key) or sb_publishable_. Check for stray spaces or missing characters.",

