  "车行附加的延保、油漆保护、GAP 可以拒绝；逐项核对 doc fee 和税费。": "Dealer add-ons (extended warranty, paint protection, GAP) can be declined; check the doc fee and taxes line by line.",
  "付定金 / 尾款或贷款放款；私人交易用银行本票，到银行当面交割": "Pay the deposit / balance or have the loan funded; for a private sale use a cashier's check and meet at the bank",
  "产权证（title）：卖方签字并填里程申报；贷款车 title 由贷款行持有": "Title: seller signs and fills in the odometer disclosure; on a financed car the lender holds the title",
  "私人交易：卖方在 title 背面签字、填里程；车行代办。": "Private sale: the seller signs the back of the title and fills in the mileage; a dealer handles it for you.",
  "保险在提车前生效，把这辆车加进保单": "Insurance effective before pickup; add the car to your policy", "没有保险不能上路；车行放车前通常要看保险卡。": "You can't drive without insurance; dealers usually ask for the insurance card before releasing the car.",
  "提车：两把钥匙、手册、随车工具、临牌或原车牌；拍里程表和外观": "Pickup: both keys, manual, tool kit, temporary or existing plates; photograph the odometer and exterior",
  "申请产权与上牌、缴车辆使用税（伊州 VSD 190 + RUT-50；车行代办用 RUT-25），20 天内": "Apply for title and registration and pay use tax (IL: VSD 190 + RUT-50; dealers file RUT-25) within 20 days",
  "排放检测（伊州车龄 4 年以上两年一次；逾期不能续牌照）": "Emissions test (IL: cars over 4 years old, every two years; overdue blocks plate renewal)",
  "Chicago / village 车贴（city sticker）：住市内 30 天内办": "Chicago / village city sticker: within 30 days if you live in the city",
  "在本应用补齐车辆档案：车牌、里程、年均里程、牌照 / 排放到期、保险": "Complete the vehicle record here: plate, mileage, annual miles, registration / emissions due dates, insurance",
  "车贷：建账单提醒或自动扣款；记下贷款合同和 title 存放位置": "Car loan: set up a bill reminder or autopay; note where the loan contract and title are kept",
  "留存购车发票、bill of sale、临牌回执": "Keep the invoice, bill of sale and temporary plate receipt", "查首保要求（里程 / 月份），到时记第一次保养": "Check the first-service requirement (miles / months) and log it when done",
  "贷款中：向贷款行查还款余额（payoff）和 title 放行流程": "Financed: get the payoff amount and title-release process from the lender",
