  "还没有车辆档案": "No vehicles yet", "记下年款、车牌、里程和动力类型，按月或按里程提醒机油、轮胎、刹车油、12V 电瓶等；牌照、排放、保险到期也会提醒。油车和电车用不同的保养模板。": "Record the year, plate, mileage and powertrain; get reminders by time or mileage for oil, tires, brake fluid, the 12V battery and more, plus registration, emissions and insurance. Gas and electric cars use different service templates.",
