  "车险": "Auto insurance", "几辆车同一张保单就填同一个号，提醒会合并": "Cars on one policy share the number; reminders merge", "例如：责任 100/300/50、碰撞自付 $500、综合自付 $250": "e.g. liability 100/300/50, $500 collision deductible, $250 comprehensive", "账单里的“车险”负责缴费提醒，这里负责续保和保障范围。": "The Auto insurance bill handles payments; this tracks renewal and coverage.",
  "年款与保修": "Model year and warranty", "购车日期": "Purchase date", "没有保养记录时，按它算第一次保养": "Used for the first service when there are no logs yet", "年款": "Model year", "整车保修到": "Bumper-to-bumper warranty until", "动力总成 / 高压电池保修到": "Powertrain / HV battery warranty until", "电车高压电池通常 8 年 / 10 万英里": "EV batteries are usually 8 years / 100k miles", "购车价格": "Purchase price",
