  "保养时间表": "Service schedule", "按月和按里程取先到的；里程按年均里程推算": "Whichever comes first, by months or mileage; mileage is projected from miles per year", "项目": "Item", "周期": "Interval", "上次": "Last", "下次": "Next", "{n} 个月": "{n} months", "记一次后开始算": "starts after the first log", "逾期 {d} 天": "{d} days overdue", "{d} 天后": "in {d} days",
