  "填购车日期或记第一次保养后，这里会列出下一步该做的保养。": "Add the purchase date or log a first service to see what's due next.", "牌照": "Registration", "排放": "Emissions", "保险": "Insurance", "租赁": "Lease", "牌照年贴": "Registration", "排放检测": "Emissions test", "车险续保": "Insurance renewal", "租赁到期": "Lease end",
